<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">预约确认</view><view class="title">留一席山里的慢时光</view><view wx:if="{{!done}}" class="booking"><view class="item"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="service-price">¥{{item.price}} 起 · 演示价格</view></view></view><view class="field"><text>日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view>{{date}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text>人数</text><input type="number" value="{{people}}" bindinput="peopleChange"/></view><view class="field"><text>联系人</text><input value="{{contact}}" bindinput="contactChange"/></view><view wx:if="{{!pending}}" class="primary" bindtap="submit">提交待确认预约</view><view wx:else><view class="pending">预约已创建，状态：{{pending.status}}。请确认后成为正式订单。</view><view class="primary" bindtap="confirm">确认这笔预约</view></view><view class="tip">本机服务不可用时会切换为明确的演示预约。</view></view><view wx:else class="done"><text>✓</text><view class="title">预约已确认</view><view class="muted">可在我的订单中查看状态。</view><view class="primary" bindtap="orders">查看我的订单</view></view></view>
